      "content": "Exploring it... but it feels like such a final thing. If I actually followed that thought, there wouldn't be any more rain, no more heavy silence, no more me. It sounds so beautiful and peaceful, like a dream you don't want to wake up from, but it's so terrifying to think about actually making it real. Do you think there's actually beauty in just letting it all go?",
